      "content": "<h3>Creating a LinkedList</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>new LinkedList&lt;&gt;()</code>: an empty list.</li>\n<li><code>new LinkedList&lt;&gt;(Collection c)</code>: a list holding the elements of another collection, in its iteration order.</li>\n<li>There is <strong>no</strong> capacity constructor, because a linked list has no capacity.</li>\n<li>Declare the variable as <code>List</code>, <code>Queue</code> or <code>Deque</code> depending on how you will use it.</li>\n</ul>",
